   "Mod" means any modification, replacement asset, patch, model, texture, sound,
   script, or other content made for Dead Rising 2: Case Zero or Dead Rising 2: Case
   West, wherever it was made with the help of the Software.

   "Sell" or "Commercial Use" means offering something in exchange for money, payment
   in kind, cryptocurrency, subscription, membership, or any other compensation. It
   includes putting it behind a paywall, a subscription or membership platform (for
   example Patreon, Ko-fi memberships, Fanbox, Gumroad, OnlyFans, or paid Discord
   roles), a paid early-access or timed-exclusive period, or a "donate to download"
   gate.

